  "_own_docs_policy": "POLICY (2026.07 docs rework): own_docs are NO LONGER configured here. They are the canonical customer docs authored in the repo at docs/enterprise/**.md, baked into the help image at /app/own_docs by the Dockerfile, and AUTO-DISCOVERED at runtime by cache_manager.discover_own_docs() (one card per .md, title = the file's H1, grouped by docs/enterprise/<section>/). To add/edit an own doc, change docs/enterprise/ \u2014 never this file. This 'own_docs' section is intentionally empty and kept only so legacy readers of the key see [] rather than the old hand-maintained stub list. The 'apps' array above (the 27 upstream cached mirrors) is unaffected: external modules still get a mirror_url entry there, never an own_docs stub."
}
